@HRMS.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7150

### 1. Register a New User
POST {{HRMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### 2. Login to Get Signed JWT Token
# @name loginRequest
POST {{HRMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store Token Variable
@authToken = {{loginRequest.response.body.token}}

### 3. Access Protected Endpoint with JWT (Dashboard Summary)
GET {{HRMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Access Protected Employee List with JWT
GET {{HRMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/employee
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Access Protected Endpoint without Token (Will return 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{HRMS.API_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
